# Every asset in this project is text: meshes, materials and the sky are built in code, so nothing
# binary is committed. Images rendered from it (stills) live outside the project.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# LF on every platform: a CRLF in a script breaks a shebang, and in harbor_layout.json it makes every
# regeneration a whole-file diff.
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.shader text eol=lf
*.hlsl text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
